      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, I have determined that the present strike by certain of the personnel of the Department of Sanitation has resulted in an accumulation of work in such Department, the performance of which will impose upon the regular employees of such Department who have reported for duty an unreasonable and unwarranted burden, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
